HTTPS with WebSphere Application
Server

To secure web access to your application, you can configure
and start your application in HTTPS mode.

After you deploy Web Administration Tool in WebSphere® Application
Server, you can start your application. You can connect
to Web Administration Tool securely
by providing
HTTPS web address and the secure port.

To use HTTPS, provide the following web address to accessWeb
Administration Tool:

https://hostname:12101/IDSWebApp

To use non-HTTPS connection, provide the following web address
to accessWeb Administration Tool:

http://hostname:12100/IDSWebApp

